### Criar cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/clientes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "0000",
  "sobrenome": "Silva",
  "telefone": "44 99999999",
  "email": "800@gmail.com"
}

### GET cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes/3
Content-Type: application/json


### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Content-Type: application/json